{
  "id": "RAW_18b8665145",
  "title": "GPT-6 的改进提示缓存",
  "url": "https://openai.com/index/better-prompt-caching-for-gpt-6",
  "date": "2026-09-23 05:00:00",
  "author": "OpenAI",
  "siteName": "OpenAI News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"w-full\">\n   <div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"--hero-aspect-ratio:16/9;--hero-aspect-ratio-mobile:3/4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n     <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-span-8 toc-visible:@md:col-start-1\">\n      <div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n       <div class=\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center\">\n        <p class=\"text-meta text-primary-100\">\n         <br>\n        </p>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n   <nav aria-label=\"Table of contents\" class=\"sticky top-header-h z-50 col-span-full -mx-6 h-0 w-[calc(100%+2*(--spacing(6)))] -translate-y-px transition duration-medium md:hidden opacity-0\" inert>\n    <div class=\"relative mx-auto w-(--document-width) border-b border-primary-4 bg-secondary-100\">\n     <div class=\"force-show-scrollbars relative mx-auto w-full overflow-auto xl:max-w-container-desktop\">\n      <button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex h-toc-button-h w-full px-6 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 focus-visible:outline-primary-100\"><span class=\"truncate pe-5 text-xs leading-tight text-primary-100\">Monitor caching and diagnose cache misses</span></button>\n      <button inert type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close table of contents\" class=\"absolute inset-e-6 -top-px z-10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-primary-100 pointer-events-none\"></button>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </nav>\n   <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] in-data-article-contained:flex in-data-article-contained:flex-col col-span-full min-w-0 md:row-start-1\">\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>GPT‑6 enables persistent agents to work for hours on complex tasks, from refactoring codebases to producing well-researched documents and presentations. The applications behind these agents make a series of API requests that build on one another, often carrying forward the same instructions, tool definitions, and context from earlier turns. OpenAI caches that shared context to reuse computation across requests, reducing response times and giving developers discounts of up to 90% on cached input tokens.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>With the GPT‑6 family, we launched an improved prompt caching system that delivers higher cache hit rates by default. We now give cache discounts for eligible shared prefixes reused within a 30-minute window. We’re also introducing new tools to help developers monitor cache performance, diagnose misses, and choose how much of a prompt to cache.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6 py-8\">\n     <section class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n      <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1\">\n       <div>\n        <div class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 relative rounded-md border shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08)]\">\n         <div class=\"px-6 pb-8 pt-8\">\n          <div class=\"no-scrollbar relative scroll-smooth overflow-visible\">\n           <div class=\"sticky inset-s-0 top-0 w-full\">\n            <figure class=\"row-start-1 gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] opacity-100\">\n             <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mb-4\">\n              <span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"GitHub logo\" class=\"ms-2 dark:brightness-0 dark:invert block h-8 w-32 max-w-full bg-contain bg-left bg-no-repeat md:w-48\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_GitHub_Lockup_Black.svg&quot;)\"></span>\n             </div>\n             <blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\">\n              <span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>OpenAI’s prompt caching plays a critical role in helping GitHub Copilot deliver fast, efficient experiences at scale. Over the past several months, we’ve reduced by more than 50% the share of prompt tokens requiring fresh processing across billions of requests to OpenAI models, relative to our previous baseline. The result is a more efficient inference stack and faster time to first response for developers.</span>”\n             </blockquote>\n             <figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\">\n              <span>—Mario Rodriguez, Chief Product Officer</span>\n             </figcaption>\n            </figure>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\">\n     <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"monitor-caching-and-diagnose-cache-misses\">\n      <div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2\">\n       <h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\"><span>Monitor caching and diagnose cache misses</span></h2>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>The new </span><a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/usage?usage_section=prompt-caching\" class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>Prompt Caching Dashboard</span></u>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> shows how much of your application’s input is served from cache. Track hit rates over time and use the input composition chart to compare cached and uncached tokens. These views help you spot drops in cache hits and evaluate how changes to your application impact caching performance.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-16 not-last:mb-16\">\n     <figure class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\">\n      <div class=\"col-span-full flex min-h-0 flex-col gap-6 toc-visible:@md:col-start-2\">\n       <div class=\"flex min-h-0 w-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-6 @sm:flex-row @sm:gap-x-10 @sm:has-[&gt;:nth-child(2)]:[--dotcom-chart-edge-gutter:0px] [&amp;_[data-dotcom-chart-logical-container][style*='width:_min-content']]:[--dotcom-chart-edge-gutter:0px] [--dotcom-chart-edge-gutter:var(--container-inline-gutter,0px)] md:[--dotcom-chart-edge-gutter:0px] shaded-container:[--dotcom-chart-edge-gutter:0px] items-start\">\n        <div class=\"w-full mx-auto transition-opacity duration-medium ease-curve-c max-w-container-desktop relative min-h-0\">\n         <div class=\"relative min-h-0 w-full\">\n          <div class=\"size-full\">\n           <div class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-md aspect-auto size-full bg-transparent transition-[background] duration-medium ease-curve-d\">\n            <picture class=\"mx-auto\"><source media=\"(min-width: 768px) and (prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 750w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 828w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202733_image__16_.png 1080w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202733_image__16_.png 1200w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 3840w\"><source media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202733_image__17_.png 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 750w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 828w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 1080w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202733_image__17_.png 1200w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 3840w\"><source media=\"(max-width: 767px) and (prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 750w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202733_image__16_.png 828w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 1080w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 1200w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__16_.png 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202733_image__16_.png 3840w\"><img alt=\"Prompt caching dashboard showing cache hit rate, cache performance over time, and input token composition.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"mx-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1728px) 1728px, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 640w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 750w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202733_image__17_.png 828w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 1080w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 1200w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 1920w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 2048w, https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png 3840w\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_image__17_.png\"></picture>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </figure>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>When you see an unexpected cache miss, use the </span><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/prompt-caching/diagnostics\" class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>prompt caching diagnostics tool</span></u>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> to understand what happened. Compare a request with a recent response to identify changes to the model, tools, settings, or input that prevented reuse. The estimated number of affected tokens helps you assess the size of the impact and decide how you can optimize your integration to maximize cache hit rates. </span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6\">\n     <div class=\"group/component-group [--component-container-gutter:initial] [--component-container-max-width:initial]\">\n      <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n       <div class=\"col-span-full w-full items-stretch gap-12 toc-visible:@md:col-start-2\">\n        <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] mb-8\">\n         <div class=\"prose max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2\">\n          <pre><code class=\"language-json\">{\n  \"prompt_cache_diagnostics\": {\n    \"type\": \"cache_miss\",\n    \"reason\": \"tools_changed\",\n    \"comparison_reusable_tokens\": 5629,\n    \"cache_missed_tokens\": 5629\n  }\n}\n</code></pre>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\">\n     <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] toc-content-heading scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"optimize-caching-for-your-application\">\n      <div class=\"full-grid-content:@md:col-span-full full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2\">\n       <h2 class=\"text-h3 scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\"><span>Optimize caching for your application</span></h2>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><b><span>Choose what to cache.</span></b><span> Explicit cache breakpoints let you choose which prompt prefixes to reuse. The refreshed </span><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/prompt-caching\" class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>prompt caching guide</span></u>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> explains how to use them, how long cached prefixes remain eligible, and how changes to tools and inputs affect reuse.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><b><span>Adjust reasoning effort without breaking cache.</span></b><span> On GPT‑6 models, you can now </span><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/reasoning?api-mode=responses#change-reasoning-mid-conversation\" class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>change reasoning effort</span></u>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> between responses without breaking cache. Raise effort for a harder task or lower it for a routine follow-up by appending a </span><span class=\"prose\"><code class=\"wrap-anywhere\"><span>configuration_update</span></code></span><span> while leaving request-level reasoning effort unchanged. This lets you adjust how much reasoning a task needs while preserving reusable context.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><b><span>Preserve cache as tools and instructions change.</span></b><span> As your agent’s tool use needs change, keep tool definitions, schemas, and ordering stable so earlier context stays reusable. Use </span><span class=\"prose\"><code class=\"wrap-anywhere\"><span>allowed_tools</span></code></span><span> to make only the relevant tools callable, or set tool_choice to none when no tools are needed, instead of removing definitions. Use new developer messages to append new instructions towards the end of the context to override older ones. See our </span><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/prompt-caching#manage-tools-with-append-only-updates\" class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>guidance on managing tool changes</span></u>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span>.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><b><span>Prewarm the cache to reduce latency.</span></b><span> </span><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/prompt-caching#prewarm-the-cache\" class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 underline-offset-[0.25rem] decoration-1 underline relative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><u class=\"decoration-1 underline-offset-4\"><span>Prewarming</span></u>⁠<span class=\"sr-only\">(opens in a new window)</span></a><span> prepares known context ahead of time so the model can start responding sooner when a request arrives. For example, an application can prewarm shared instructions, tool definitions, or reference material during startup, before the user asks their first question. This moves processing out of the user’s wait time.</span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\">\n     <p class=\"mb-6 last:mb-0\"><span>These optional controls build on the engine’s default performance, helping you tailor caching to your workload. </span></p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6 py-8\">\n     <section class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\">\n      <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1\">\n       <div>\n        <div class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 relative rounded-md border shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08)]\">\n         <div class=\"px-6 pb-8 pt-8\">\n          <div class=\"absolute inset-e-6 z-2 flex justify-end top-8\">\n           <div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3\">\n            <span class=\"text-meta text-primary-60\">1 of 3</span>\n            <div class=\"flex\">\n             <button type=\"button\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 focus:outline-primary-44 text-btn-media-label\" disabled aria-label=\"Previous testimonial\">\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"></svg>\n             </button>\n             <button type=\"button\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 text-primary-60 hover:bg-primary-4 hover:[&amp;&gt;svg]:opacity-60 focus:outline-primary-44 -ms-1 active:scale-95\" aria-label=\"Next testimonial\">\n              <svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"></svg>\n             </button>\n            </div>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"no-scrollbar relative scroll-smooth overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden overscroll-x-contain\">\n           <div class=\"sticky inset-s-0 top-0 w-full\">\n            <figure aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"row-start-1 gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] opacity-100\">\n             <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 mb-10\">\n              <span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Strawberry Browser logo\" class=\"ms-2 dark:brightness-0 dark:invert block h-8 w-32 max-w-full bg-contain bg-left bg-no-repeat md:w-48\" style=\"background-image:url(&quot;https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260922202732_strawberry-monochrome-logo.svg&quot;)\"></span>\n             </div>\n             <blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\">\n              <span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>OpenAI’s prompt caching diagnostics and dashboard helped us improve cache hit rates by a few percentage points, reducing costs by 20%. We now get alerts when caching breaks unexpectedly and use Codex agents to diagnose the root cause. Explicit breakpoints also let us cache stable context while keeping frequently changing content at the end of the prompt. That’s made it economically viable to fork conversations for background tasks while reusing nearly all of the shared context.</span>”\n             </blockquote>\n             <figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\">\n              <span>—Arian Hanifi, Chief Technology Officer</span>\n             </figcaption>\n            </figure>\n           </div>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"relative mt-3 overflow-hidden\">\n         <ul class=\"relative flex\" style=\"width:100%\" aria-label=\"Testimonials\">\n          <li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\">\n           <button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"true\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Strawberry Browser\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4 text-primary-100 md:text-primary-60\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Strawberry Browser</span></button>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\">\n           <button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Manus\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Manus</span></button>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 33.333333333333336%\">\n           <button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Wordsmith\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Wordsmith</span></button>\n          </li>\n         </ul>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-16\">\n     <div class=\"w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-